WEBVTT

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.290
What's gotten into you?

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:16.750
Noela?!

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.120
It attacked me.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.580
Attacked? Who did?

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.170
The squirrel.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.670
That should do it.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:45.350
<b>Poison-Be-Gone</b>

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:40.530
<i>Poison-Be-Gone.</i>

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:45.350
<i>In addition to being a sedative, 
it also removes toxic substances.</i>

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.310
Master, the squirrel was in pain.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.500
Maybe it accidentally ate a poisonous nut.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.930
Makes sense.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.610
Once the medicine takes effect, 
it should return to its burrow.

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.920
We should head home, too.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.910
Woof!

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.590
<b>The Next Morning</b>

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.590
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.260
What a wonderful morning... Huh?

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.310
Mr. Reiji!

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.150
Look at this.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.700
A squirrel brought these.

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:31.700
A squirrel?

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:36.200
<b>Rokushou Nuts\h\h\h</b>

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.780
<i>Rokushou nuts.</i>

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.200
<i>A very fragrant nut.</i>

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:40.780
Rokushou nuts? Are they like a spice?

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.040
Delicious! Delicious!

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.080
Are these okay to eat raw?

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.210
I want to believe in Noela's 
feral constitution.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.420
But why did a squirrel bring these here?

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:55.880
Master saved the squirrel!

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:57.340
Oh, my.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.460
Oh, that squirrel?

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.160
Perhaps it was trying to thank you.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.850
It was repaying the favor.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.660
Repaying the favor, huh?

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.090
These will make a good snack for Noela.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:20.290
<b>Drugstore</b>

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:20.290
<b>In Another World</b>

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:48.080
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 1
Rokushou Sauce</b>

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:45.790
Since then, the squirrel has been 
bringing us rokushou nuts every day.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.910
It gave us so many today, too.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.160
But I don't know how to cook them.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.380
And we don't have any ingredients 
to cook them with, anyway.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.550
Sorry, I forgot to go shopping.

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:01.610
I'll pick up lunch at the Rabbit Tavern.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:04.510
Woof, woof. Rabbit food, rabbit food.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.720
Since it's lunchtime, they might be busy.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.140
Get out of here!

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:11.560
Wasn't that the guy who 
runs the Rabbit Tavern?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.890
I'm not selling this shop to you.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:18.860
<b>Rena</b>

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:18.860
<b>Tavern Owner
 (Rena's Dad)</b>

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.880
Get out of here already.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:19.350
I won't talk about that anymore.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:23.700
<b>Fernando</b>

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:23.700
But I appreciate your cooking skills.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.160
What do you say?

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:28.080
Why not work for me?

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:32.010
No! This shop is full of our memories.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:34.000
I won't let it close so easily.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.710
Now leave!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.920
Well, good luck to you.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:45.380
I'm already excited for the 
day you'll come crying to me.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.180
I shall leave for today.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.100
What's this?

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:59.820
I see you still have eccentric customers 
coming to your dingy little shop.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.280
Excuse me.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.770
What's his problem?

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:13.740
Woof!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.170
Mr. Pharmacist and Li'l Wolf.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.420
Sorry you had to see that.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:24.880
It's fine. Who was that guy who 
looked like his name must be Pierre?

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.480
Pierre?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.680
He's the owner of Combdale.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:35.140
It's a restaurant serving tasty meat 
dishes that recently opened nearby.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.600
He wants you to sell your shop?

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:42.190
He's trying to buy out all the competition.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.400
You mean he's harassing you.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.680
We've been running this shop forever.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:54.750
We can't just hand it over to him.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.890
It's not a question of money.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:00.350
I doubt I'd ever let go of my shop, either.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:04.960
Mr. Pharmacist, what should we do?

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.170
Rena.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.380
You can have these.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.360
They'll cheer you up.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.110
Li'l Wolf....

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.180
I love rabbit food.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.400
Li'l Wolf, thank you!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.650
Woof...

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.280
This smell...

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.450
Are these rokushou nuts?

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.650
Yes, they are.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.850
Where did you get these?

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.200
From a squirrel.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.390
A squirrel?

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:34.350
Woof.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:37.580
It's a long story. I'll tell 
you about it another time.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:41.330
Rokushou nuts are a high-quality ingredient 
that's incredibly hard to find.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.670
This is a high-quality ingredient?

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.830
Even some of the greatest 
chefs around couldn't

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.960
get their hands on them, 
no matter how hard they looked.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:52.890
On top of that, they're difficult to cook with.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.340
When some were given to the king's palace,

00:06:55.340 --> 00:07:00.110
a legendary royal chef apparently 
succeeded in creating a sauce.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:04.310
That's amazing. Then let's make 
something based on that recipe.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.230
The thing is...

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:10.980
Before they could pass on 
their recipe to anyone else,

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:15.320
that chef died after eating too much 
of that sauce because it was so good.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.780
Oh, no...

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:21.660
I see. If we could make that 
rare sauce using these...

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:26.300
Could you let me handle this?

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:28.260
A pharmacist?

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.390
We've got the ingredients.

00:07:30.390 --> 00:07:33.290
We just need to make our own rokushou sauce.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.720
That's how we can fight back 
against that restaurant.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.900
I'll protect the rabbit food!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:39.450
Oh...

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:40.410
"Oh"?

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:44.610
I ate all the rokushou nuts.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.520
Wha...

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.720
What?!

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:57.500
Since this was where we 
encountered the squirrel,

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.910
I thought we might be able 
to find them here, but...

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.370
Not here.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.830
He did say they were rare.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:10.060
The forest is deep. 
Maybe they're farther away.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:15.430
I see. Then the squirrel must've gone 
to a lot of trouble to bring us those.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.850
Woof. The squirrel is 
serious about thanking you.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.580
Now it's our turn to thank it.

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:25.810
Maybe I'll leave it an energy potion.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:28.770
Woof. I'm sure it'll like that.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:34.690
All right. Shall we head home?

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:36.070
Woof!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.250
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:45.820
I suppose finding them is as difficult 
as you'd expect for a rare nut.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:51.350
Master, I'm sorry I ate them.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:52.970
It's okay.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.390
You couldn't help it. 
They were delicious, after all.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.850
Yeah. What are we going to do, though?

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.650
The rokushou nuts are the 
whole point. Without those...

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:03.350
Woof?

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:04.980
Rain?

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.480
What?!

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:11.820
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.820
Are these for the energy potion?

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.660
This is a huge help. Now we can make the sauce.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.630
Thank you, squirrel.

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:19.780
Woof!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:42.940
Done!

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:53.280
<b>Rokushou Sauce</b>

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.140
<i>Rokushou Sauce.</i>

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.930
<i>Characterized by its 
elegant and refined aroma.</i>

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:50.790
<i>It's acidic with a refreshing aftertaste.</i>

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.280
<i>Not even the king gets to taste it often.</i>

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:59.220
Smells good. Okay, the next steps 
will take place at the Rabbit Tavern.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:00.870
Yeah!

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.630
Sniff, sniff. Sniff, sniff.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.730
What is this smell? I recognize it!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.760
I know what this is.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:15.300
This was served at a dinner 
party at the king's palace.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:23.010
Who was it? Who made this?

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.930
<i>Rabbit...</i>

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.140
Woof.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:30.770
Welcome.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:36.150
Mr. Pierre, if you want some, 
you'll have to get in line.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.880
You skipped the line when 
you came in, didn't you?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.950
I am not Pierre! My name is Fernando!

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.900
Happy?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:49.080
<b>1 Hour Later</b>

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.080
May I take your order, Mr. Pierre?

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.790
Who are you calling Pierre?

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:54.830
You've got a rokushou sauce, haven't you?

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:57.090
I'd like a dish that uses that.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.910
Very well.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.590
Thank you for waiting.

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.990
I'll pour the sauce on now. 
One moment, please.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.560
Eat it while it's hot.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:13.720
Sniff, sniff.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:18.530
This rich aroma... It practically 
bursts at the tip of my nose.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.240
I'll try it now.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:30.120
<i>The rich aroma spreads with every bite!</i>

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:31.960
<i>Another bite.</i>

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:39.410
<i>Even after swallowing, it remains 
in the back of my nose, but...</i>

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:44.970
<i>What is this feeling that's as 
refreshing as a clear-flowing river?</i>

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:50.570
<i>This flavor makes me wish
I could keep eating it forever!</i>

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:55.410
<i>Not only that, but a single plate 
of this costs only 500 rin?</i>

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:59.790
<i>This dish that goes as well with 
drinks as it does with bread?!</i>

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.220
You ate that in a flash.

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.680
You didn't choke, did you?

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:10.700
Who made this Rokushou Sauce?

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:14.020
No one should be able to 
make that! Was it the owner?

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.440
Was it? Who knows?

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.940
We've got customers waiting.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.920
Could you vacate your table, please?

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:25.480
We'll protect the Rabbit Tavern.

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:30.990
<i>It wasn't the owner.</i>

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:33.560
<i>If he could make this, 
he would've made it before.</i>

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:36.370
<i>For the same reason, it wasn't the daughter.</i>

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.020
<i>Which means...</i>

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.700
<i>Could it really be?!</i>

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:41.400
Come on, everyone.

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.030
We've still got plenty of food and sauce.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:45.950
Form a line, please.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:47.820
You.

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:48.500
Huh?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.950
Whoa, whoa, whoa... What are you doing?

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.970
You made the sauce, didn't you?

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:57.920
I'll buy each serving for 500,000 rin.

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:03.080
I made the sauce to be used 
at the Rabbit Tavern only.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.630
If you want it, you'll have to talk to the owner.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:06.860
You little...

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.050
How about 600,000?

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.630
700,000.

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.820
800,000!

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:20.820
Not everyone is motivated by money.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:24.610
In that case...

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.230
Please sell it to me! I'm begging you!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.010
One trillion rin.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:30.740
One—

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:35.960
I-If you could just tell me where 
you acquired your rokushou nuts...

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.290
An acquaintance of mine 
leaves them at my house.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.730
Who is this acquaintance?

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:43.550
A squirrel.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:48.240
A squirrel? You bully!

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.680
Don't you think you're too old to cry?

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.820
Pierre, you can have this.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.700
So cheer up.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.970
Master, Mina is waiting.

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.110
You're right. We should get going.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:04.690
Huh?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.990
Damn it!

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:09.710
I lost!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.700
But it's so good!

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:18.160
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:18.160
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 2
 Emotional Drive</b>

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.160
Welcome.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.600
Oh, Ms. Feris.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:23.130
Um, Mr. Alchemist...

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.590
What?

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.050
I have a request!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:26.720
Personal space!

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:31.640
You see... I want to have Zeral's baby!

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:42.310
Recently, Zeral and I haven't 
been doing it very much.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.930
"Doing it"?

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:51.060
I don't know if there's something wrong 
with him or if he has a mistress, but I...

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:49.520
Oh, no.

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:55.200
I'm so anxious and anxious 
and anxious that I—

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:55.200
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa...

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.870
Hey, wait. Here, have some tea.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.250
<b>Landenflower Tea</b>

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.500
I'm so anxious, I can't sleep at night.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:11.350
For some reason, I sleep well 
when I drink this tea, though.

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:12.890
Well, that's good.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:23.900
Mr. Alchemist, c-could you make me an 
aphrodisiac to put Zeral in the mood?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.800
Very well! I'll think about it!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:34.110
<i>That said, first I need to question him.</i>

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:38.330
<b>Alonzo Family Farm</b>

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.040
How have things been with Ms. Feris recently?

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.020
Gotten into any arguments?

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:47.460
What? No, why? Is something the matter?

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.740
Uh, um...

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:56.560
<i>Can I tell him that Ms. Feris 
asked me to make an aphrodisiac?</i>

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.680
<i>I'm sure there's some 
confidentiality issue here.</i>

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.140
Mr. Reiji?

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:04.300
It's nothing. I'm glad to hear it.

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:08.940
Are the two of you thinking about 
getting married in the future?

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:10.510
Married?

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:13.570
Yes, I've been thinking about it.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.410
She's from a wealthy merchant 
family from a neighboring town.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.370
I see.

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:21.000
Both our parents approve of our relationship.

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.250
But where is this coming from?

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:28.120
Well, normally, I feel there's a proper order 
to things that should be followed,

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:31.460
but if you love each other and you're 
thinking about a future together,

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.650
then maybe it's okay.

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:34.880
Besides, both your families are rich.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:43.940
<b>Emotional Drive</b>

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.740
<i>Emotional Drive.</i>

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:43.610
<i>A medicine that strengthens emotions.</i>

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:47.290
Its acronym could stand for something else.

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:51.850
I'm not sure if this will work, 
but I'll give it to Zeral tomorrow.

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:53.950
Mr. Reiji, you have a customer.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.710
I'll be right there.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:03.790
Thank you.

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:08.310
Boy, I worked hard today.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:12.380
Mina, this is a new tasty flavor.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.010
Oh, thank you.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:21.780
M-Mina, don't drink that!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:26.770
I'm sorry. I couldn't help myself.

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.820
Huh? What?

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:34.780
Mr. Reiji, wh-what shall I do?

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:45.920
Mr. Reiji, I feel incredibly naughty.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.660
At least you're honest.

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:52.090
<i>No! Crap... Do I have anything for her?</i>

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.010
<i>Oh, yeah! I've got that 
antidote I fed the squirrel!</i>

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.310
Mr. Reiji, where are you going?

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:01.390
Where am I going?

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.540
You're the one who did this to me.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.540
Hey, cut that out!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:07.480
Don't blame me if you want to 
die of embarrassment later.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.290
I'm already dead.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:11.670
<i>I can't argue with that!</i>

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:14.780
I mean you'll regret what you've 
done once you return to your senses.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.360
Ever I since I died,

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:21.780
I've been regretting all kinds of things.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.110
One more regret couldn't hurt.

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:25.500
Jeez, that's heavy.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.000
Huh? Noela?

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:29.460
Tastes like energy. Energy is important.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.540
I have been feelin' tired recently.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:33.920
Wait! If you drink that—

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:41.890
Ms. Noela again? Please 
pay more attention to me.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:45.760
Otherwise, I'll haunt you.

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:48.230
<b>I'll Haunt You</b>

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:48.230
Don't make that sound so cheery!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:52.890
Woof!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:05.820
Pharmacist, I feel kinda strange.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.340
I knew it.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:09.790
You knew it?

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:11.750
Aw, shucks.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.960
Our uncouth captain is showin' 
off her feminine side!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.460
So cute!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:17.770
Do your jobs.

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:20.220
Mr. Reiji is busy.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.370
He has to do dirty things with me.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:24.640
What?!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:28.300
Y'all don't mind if I join, do you?

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:30.890
What a good idea.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.780
That's a terrible idea!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.900
Mina is feeling better.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:38.570
Master's tasty potions fix 
everything. Energy is important.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.500
Noela!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:43.820
Oh, right! Bring me that antidote!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:46.060
Okay, Master. You can count on me.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.840
Master, I remembered I have something to do.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.760
Pharmacist.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.720
Mr. Reiji.

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:08.730
You guys!

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.530
Why did I do that?

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:24.240
I told you, it's not my 
problem if you regret it.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:27.850
You're lucky you were able 
to take the antidote.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.860
M-Master...

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:33.290
I broke your medicines.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:34.180
Woof...

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.710
Okay, okay.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.550
You already apologized. It's okay.

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.550
Master...

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.370
Mr. Reiji, listen to this.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.620
Hold on.

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:49.260
What's this?

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:53.180
I suppose you could call 
it an energizing medicine.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.730
I see.

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:12.680
Mr. Reiji, I feel so hot for some reason.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:15.900
<i>The effects of the ED medicine were proven.</i>

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.460
<b>Several Days Later</b>

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.160
<i>And then...</i>

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:18.860
Feris, I love you.

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.600
I love you, too.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:23.920
Well, I love you times a million.

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:24.860
<i>I'm just glad my customers seem satisfied.</i>

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.180
And I love you times...

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.180
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.620
<i>Just great.</i>

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.350
<i>Just get married already.</i>

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:31.850
<b>Best Wishes!</b>

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:33.520
<b>Closing Time</b>

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:34.980
Kirio Drugstore.

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:36.140
Thank you...

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.100
...for visiting...

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.580
...again today.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.940
Woof!

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:49.780
Another.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:55.540
D-Demon King, you'll upset your stomach.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:02.350
Brother...

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:04.960
<b>Next Customer</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: Syutsuri</b>
